{
  "$Comment": "The Greater Disenchanting Table block, on the vanilla Arcane table's model: two blocks wide (the Bench_Alchemy hitbox), centred half a block to the left of the block itself. The vanilla Bench and BlockEntity groups are left out because this is a station, and Use runs RPG_Station_Disenchanting_Table_Greater_Use. Its Working state is the Arcane table's own lit texture and idle animation (the book, its gem and the candle bob together) under a soft violet light, teal sparks on the Gem part (the gem's own colour), a flame on the Flame part, the block's top glow on each flip into the state, and a hum that ducks the music and quiets the room (RPG_SFX_Disenchant_Hum); Drawing, held by the ritual's Draw and Surge beats, adds violet motes over the Plate and turns the sparks violet under a stronger violet light. Every state a station or a step names must be defined here or the flip silently does nothing. The Recipe is a vanilla-style upgrade at the Arcane bench: the lesser table plus thorium, silk and Void essence. A pack that ships a same-id copy without a Recipe makes it uncraftable and hands it out its own way.",
